Package: fastconley
Type: Package
Title: Fast Conley Standard Errors for felm() and feols() Models
Version: 0.6.1
Authors@R: person("Richard", "Bluhm", email = "richard.bluhm@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Richard Bluhm <richard.bluhm@gmail.com>
Description: Conley (1999) spatial HAC standard errors for linear fixed effects
    panel models and cross-sectional models estimated with lfe::felm() or
    fixest::feols(). The spatial path uses score accumulation, a 3D cell-grid
    neighbor search, and CSR neighbor lists instead of dense distance
    matrices, yielding large speedups over rbluhm/conley on big
    cross-sections and high-dimensional regressions.
